/scripts/render_v1100_proof.py
/docs/GOOGLE_FONTS_SUBMISSION.md
/docs/GEORGIAN_FONT_ENGINEERING_RULES.md

# A specimen page and renderer that need local reference fonts and system fonts.
/specimen/
/scripts/render_specimens.py
